  speakerName: "Ng\u01B0\u1EDDi k\u1EC3 chuy\u1EC7n"
  title: "T\xECm th\u1EA5y ng\xF4i l\xE0ng hoang t\xE0n"
  content: "Sau nhi\u1EC1u gi\u1EDD ch\u1EA1y tr\u1ED1n, ch\xE0ng trai nh\xECn th\u1EA5y
    ng\xF4i l\xE0ng hoang t\xE0n n\u1EB1m d\u01B0\u1EDBi thung l\u0169ng. Nh\u1EEFng
    ng\xF4i nh\xE0 b\u1ECB \u0111\u1ED5 n\xE1t, kh\xF3i c\xF2n b\u1ED1c l\xEAn t\u1EEB
    \u0111\u1ED1ng tro t\xE0n, d\xE2n ch\xFAng th\u1EA5t th\u1EA7n, run r\u1EA9y
    v\xEC b\u1ECDn c\u01B0\u1EDBp."
  portrait: {fileID: 0}
